From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mciqtz32: Seeking, set, status, where, step, cue and info commands.

The DirectShow MCI driver seeks to the end and to MCI_TO, sets door,
audio (on/off, volume, balance), video and speed, reports tracks, ready,
current track and media present, the source/destination maxima, steps,
cues, answers info, realize and setvideo, and returns
MCIERR_UNSUPPORTED_FUNCTION for the commands it does not support.
